### Valid Request
POST http://notification-system.test/api/v1/notifications
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "sms",
  "recipient": "+905551234567",
  "content": "Flash sale başladı!",
  "priority": "high",
  "idempotency_key": "test-005"
}

###  Valid Request
POST http://notification-system.test/api/v1/notifications
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "email",
  "recipient": "elifosmanoglu14@gmail.com",
  "content": "<p><b>Merhaba!</b></p>",
  "priority": "high"
}

### Invalid Request (invalid channel)
POST http://notification-system.test/api/v1/notifications
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "fax",
  "recipient": "abc",
  "content": ""
}

### Invalid Request (invalid recipient)
POST http://notification-system.test/api/v1/notifications
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "sms",
  "recipient": "elif",
  "content": ""
}

### Create Valid Batch
POST http://notification-system.test/api/v1/notifications/batch
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notifications": [
    { "channel": "sms", "recipient": "+905551234567", "content": "Batch SMS", "priority": "high", "idempotency_key": "batch-1-a" },
    { "channel": "email", "recipient": "test@example.com", "content": "Batch e-posta", "priority": "low", "idempotency_key": "batch-1-b" }
  ]
}

### Create Invalid Batch
POST http://notification-system.test/api/v1/notifications/batch
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notifications": [
    { "channel": "fax", "recipient": "+905551234567", "content": "Batch SMS", "priority": "high", "idempotency_key": "batch-2-a" },
    { "channel": "email", "recipient": "test@example.com", "content": "Batch e-posta", "priority": "low", "idempotency_key": "batch-2-b" }
  ]
}